    whatToFocusOn: 'Focus on 1991 LPG Reforms triggers and sector-wise impacts (Financial sector, Trade & Investment, Fiscal reforms), Agricultural reforms (Land ceiling, Green Revolution Phase 1 vs 2), Rural credit & Microfinance (NABARD, Kudumbashree), Informalisation of workforce, and India-China-Pakistan comparative metrics (HDI, Sectoral GDP share).',
    whatToSkip: 'Skip historical numerical data tables.',
    seniorHinglishAdvice: 'Indian Economic Development Class 11 is the most comprehensive base for UPSC GS3 Indian Economy. 1991 LPG reforms and Rural development chapters are repeatedly quoted in Mains answers.',
