    whatToFocusOn: 'Focus on Cuban Missile Crisis, Shock Therapy post-Soviet collapse, ASEAN 3 Pillars (ASEAN Community, ASEAN Way), UN Security Council reform debates & India’s permanent seat claim, Traditional vs Non-Traditional Security threats, and Kyoto Protocol CBDR principle.',
